{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"e-waste recycling\" (+ \"low recycling rate\" \"only\" \"recycled\") (+ collection awareness))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_31_1536260291#4_3126599563","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q1642","rank":1,"snippet":"Where does my electronic waste go? How does e-waste affect humans and the environment? What should I do with my old cell phones? How do I properly dispose of batteries? We offer electronic recycling and pickup for all types of devices How our service works: \" , \"segment\": \"Donate working electronics to local charities or nonprofits. Donate or sell your e-waste for parts. Check to see if your local retailers offer trade-in services or buy used goods. Find out if any local retailers offer e-waste recycling. Sell your old electronics online. Attend a hard-to-recycle or <cover>e-waste recycling event. Find out if your trash collection service accepts electronics. Electronic devices should only </cover>be thrown in a landfill as a last resort. How is electronic waste recycled? Before e-waste is recycled, it is first inspected to determine if it can be refurbished or donated.\" , \"start_char\": 1734.000000 , \"title\": \"Electronics & E-Waste Recycling & Disposal | 1-800-GOT-JUNK?\" , \"url\": \"https://www.1800gotjunk.com/us_en/what-we-take/electronics-recycling\" }"}}
